  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/manage-end-user-oauth-consent-for-ai-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
  "sourceTitle": "Manage end-user OAuth consent for AI agents with Amazon Bedrock AgentCore",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d5ac546fc8b7e91213eb3ddb73d08aecc6457584a4f7a5269d185198dd18b92a",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T08:13:20.100407Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T02:25:07.044605Z",
  "totalBlocks": 122,
  "translatedBlocks": 121,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc0ff7c2a083517f",
      "translationZh": "AI 智能体通常需要代表用户访问 GitHub 和 Slack 等服务。在智能体执行操作之前，用户必须向服务提供方进行身份验证，并明确批准所请求的访问权限。随后，应用程序必须将由此产生的 OAuth 授权安全地关联到批准该授权的用户。这一过程称为会话绑定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "548d5479b855a45c",
      "translationZh": "此前，使用 AgentCore Identity（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能）三方 OAuth（3LO）流程（也称为 OAuth 2.0 授权码流程）的客户，必须自行构建并托管会话绑定基础设施。这包括展示授权 URL、托管公共 HTTPS 回调端点、对返回的用户进行身份验证、管理浏览器会话，以及调用 CompleteResourceTokenAuth 来完成流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69805fecc296e381",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Identity 现在提供 Consent portal，这是面向 AgentCore Gateway（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能）的托管式 Web 体验和会话绑定端点。您可以为网关创建一个门户，并将其 URL 分享给用户。用户通过您组织的身份提供方（IdP）进行身份验证，查看智能体可用的服务，并向各个提供方授予同意。门户负责处理浏览器重定向和会话绑定，而 AgentCore Identity 则将由此产生的令牌存储在其令牌保管库中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca7b76f03532d359",
      "translationZh": "对于通过 IDE 和 Model Context Protocol（MCP）客户端（如 Kiro、Claude Code、Cursor 和 Visual Studio Code）访问的智能体，这项功能尤其有用。用户可以在调用工具之前授予同意，后续工具调用便可使用已为该用户存储的令牌。在本文中，我们以软件开发助手为例，逐步介绍管理员和最终用户在 AWS Management Console 和浏览器中的操作体验，并展示如何在 AWS CloudTrail 中查看由此产生的活动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29d38efaf6bdfc36",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Consent portal 通过企业 IdP 对用户进行身份验证，使用其 IAM 执行角色发现已配置的网关目标，展示提供方连接，完成会话绑定，并将每个用户的令牌存储在 AgentCore Identity 令牌保管库中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe175c39b0f341e4",
      "translationZh": "示例场景：让开发助手访问 GitHub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a119e53a0a97b8b5",
      "translationZh": "假设有一家名为 Example Corp 的公司，通过 AgentCore Gateway 为其开发人员提供 AI 编程助手。该助手有两个目标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b095007d7d0db053",
      "translationZh": "一个可以列出代码仓库并创建议题的 GitHub 目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf728515230becb5",
      "translationZh": "一个能够列出公开频道并发布消息的 Slack 目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c4c100933d21c26",
      "translationZh": "Example Corp 使用其企业 IdP 对员工进行身份验证。管理员希望每项 GitHub 和 Slack OAuth 授权始终与批准该授权的员工关联。开发者可以独立连接任一提供方，然后返回自己的 IDE，而无需反复响应提示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cca0a1cfb4db4f49",
      "translationZh": "本操作演练围绕以下两种角色展开：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be4a57374a839f38",
      "translationZh": "管理员：配置企业 IdP、GitHub 和 Slack 网关目标、执行角色以及 Consent 门户，然后将门户 URL 发送给开发者。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72f748477975d5a4",
      "translationZh": "最终用户：打开 URL，使用企业 IdP 登录，在需要时连接 GitHub，并可单独授予 Slack 访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2849d0ab376eb335",
      "translationZh": "在开始操作演练之前，Example Corp 需要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d38ee4f5b6a91b16",
      "translationZh": "一个具有 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 访问权限的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0eb89ea98f99415",
      "translationZh": "一个配置了 JWT 入站授权的 AgentCore Gateway。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a96f6ceff1ef82d0",
      "translationZh": "一个已配置的 IDE 或 MCP 客户端，可连接到将与 Consent 门户关联的同一个 AgentCore Gateway。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb6c069342489091",
      "translationZh": "对企业 IdP 的管理访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8dd06c98101f1c30",
      "translationZh": "已注册的 GitHub OAuth App，以及用于开发或测试工作区的 Slack 应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed7d58d41b3d5d2d",
      "translationZh": "在各提供方应用中注册 AgentCore Identity 回调 URL 的权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64f770e2ea09b3d8",
      "translationZh": "以下步骤展示 Example Corp 管理员需要配置的内容，以及开发者收到门户 URL 后的使用体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d844565c4e386119",
      "translationZh": "管理员操作步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b15c727bfea9db0c",
      "translationZh": "管理员完成步骤 1–6，以配置身份提供方、网关目标、执行角色和 Consent 门户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d998c661f8896ea",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：准备企业 IdP 和网关连接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d012562a8245400",
      "translationZh": "管理员 IAM 策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15bb240c7bc1bf25",
      "translationZh": "将此策略附加到执行步骤 1–3 的管理员身份。替换账户 ID。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5fef8fb15f121a2",
      "translationZh": "该 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 语句涵盖控制台上的“创建默认角色”选项，该选项会创建一个名为 AmazonBedrockAgentCoreConsentPortalDefaultServiceRole-<suffix> 的服务角色。如果你改为提供自己的角色，请将 iam:PassRole 的范围限定为该角色的 ARN。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "523f41e05104ffb7",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：配置企业 IdP 应用程序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47018106a71ce578",
      "translationZh": "在企业 IdP 中，为同意授权门户创建一个 OpenID Connect (OIDC) Web 应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f36388ee465b55c",
      "translationZh": "启用授权码授予，并生成客户端 ID 和客户端密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93f6bc6a0f6ca1af",
      "translationZh": "配置登录作用域，至少包含 openid。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "816d8e76f1413b93",
      "translationZh": "记录 OpenID Connect (OIDC) 发现 URL。门户会使用此文档中的授权端点、令牌端点和签名密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7630fc82f7ca2df9",
      "translationZh": "添加一个临时回调 URL。在第 6 步中，门户 URL 创建完成后，你会替换它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a0bf50b383d0abf",
      "translationZh": "IdP 必须签发门户能够验证的 JSON Web Token (JWT) 访问令牌。例如，使用 Okta 时，请使用自定义授权服务器，并配置允许该应用程序和授权码授权的访问策略。使用 Auth0 时，请在需要时配置受众，使 IdP 返回已签名的 JWT 访问令牌，而不是不透明令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7252e536ca43aaf8",
      "translationZh": "第 3 步：创建 IdP 凭证提供程序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a52ae69c8b33e5a",
      "translationZh": "门户从 OAuth2 凭证提供程序读取 IdP 客户端 ID 和客户端密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3abbd5589409c612",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8192df4e360621a0",
      "translationZh": "在 Build 下，选择 Identity。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6c1db7b66237e85",
      "translationZh": "在 Outbound Auth 中，选择 Add Outbound Auth，然后选择 Add OAuth client。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "841a67f8a39de63d",
      "translationZh": "输入一个名称，例如 gateway-demo-idp。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e5a45c9cc47e3f9",
      "translationZh": "输入企业 IdP 应用程序的客户端 ID 和客户端密钥，并提供 OIDC 发现配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7353d89ad0b9903c",
      "translationZh": "选择 Add OAuth client。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66f408a585080bee",
      "translationZh": "图 2：AgentCore Identity 使用一个凭证提供程序进行门户登录，并分别使用独立的出站提供程序访问 GitHub 和 Slack",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ea771ab21bc4383",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：验证出站访问的先决条件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ac9558124a91409",
      "translationZh": "创建授权同意门户之前，请确认：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edd6af8ab29b0419",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 和 Slack OAuth 应用程序已注册，且其客户端密钥已存储在 AWS Secrets Manager 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69cbac368b62f4ce",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Identity 为 GitHub 和 Slack 分别配置了独立的出站 OAuth 凭证提供程序，且每个生成的回调 URL 都已在相应的提供程序应用程序中注册。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9d6cacfb0e5e24d",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 和 Slack 网关目标使用授权码授权，仅请求所需的权限范围，并且状态为 Ready。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69e2293fa4217e37",
      "translationZh": "在步骤 5 中选择的同意门户执行角色可以读取出站凭证提供程序所引用的任何客户管理的密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e90dc323d5298727",
      "translationZh": "分配门户 URL 后，在步骤 6 中配置每个目标的默认返回 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb88591ce8f43fd3",
      "translationZh": "图 3：网关公开独立的 GitHub 和 Slack 目标，每个目标都关联各自的出站 OAuth 提供程序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "496af1abc8c6756d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：创建同意门户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32b9474b500e087a",
      "translationZh": "在“身份”页面上，“同意门户”部分列出了该账户和 AWS 区域中的门户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1f2fbc171d49632",
      "translationZh": "图 4：AgentCore Identity 页面上的“同意门户”部分。仅当网关使用需要用户同意的 3LO 时，才创建门户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f4934a2c7c73fcd",
      "translationZh": "在“同意门户”中，选择“创建门户”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "504cdbd536540eea",
      "translationZh": "在“同意门户详细信息”下的“名称”字段中，输入一个名称，例如 consent-portal-heqk0。名称长度为 1–50 个字符，可使用字母、数字、连字符和下划线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0579637ce1e96bff",
      "translationZh": "可选：输入最多 512 个字符的描述（Description）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57bb740bf7e8f4de",
      "translationZh": "对于网关（Gateway），选择开发助手的网关。网关名称会在授权同意门户（Consent portal）中向最终用户显示，因此请选择清晰、易于识别的名称。每个网关只允许有一个授权同意门户，且创建后无法更改网关。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e990ef3fdcb01f2",
      "translationZh": "在 IdP 凭证配置（IdP credential configurations）下，对于 IdP 凭证提供程序（IdP Credential Provider），选择在步骤 3 中创建的 OAuth2 凭证提供程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a72d7095f17e2adf",
      "translationZh": "在作用域（Scopes）下，保留必需的 openid 作用域。其他作用域是可选的。仅当您的 IdP 或应用程序需要其他作用域时，才选择添加作用域（Add scope）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b157cc19cfb4596a",
      "translationZh": "对于受众 — 可选（Audience – optional），除非您的网关指定了受众，否则请保持为无（None）。该值会根据 AgentCore Gateway 上配置的受众进行验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b3f644d7195cbb5",
      "translationZh": "展开权限（Permissions）。对于 IAM 权限（IAM permissions），选择创建默认角色（Create default role），让控制台创建具有所需权限的服务角色；或者选择使用其他角色（Use another role），以选择现有角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce97668c7db05f1f",
      "translationZh": "选择创建门户（Create portal）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e4b57f787603307",
      "translationZh": "图 5：当状态为正在创建（Creating）时，门户 ARN 和执行角色可见，但尚未分配 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a274f0165ca5fc73",
      "translationZh": "配置完成后，状态会变为 Active，页面上会显示授权门户 URL，点击 Launch Consent portal 按钮可在新标签页中打开该门户。URL 遵循以下格式：https://<gateway-name>.consent-portal.bedrock-agentcore.<region>.amazonaws.com。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21cc7382d6836461",
      "translationZh": "图 6：门户变为 Active 后，控制台会显示分配的 URL，你可以将其分享给最终用户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e689d184f0d765c7",
      "translationZh": "步骤 6：注册回调 URL 并发送门户 URL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "607b00a9d9fcf5f9",
      "translationZh": "从门户详情页面复制授权门户 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38fe8b097d44f697",
      "translationZh": "在企业 IdP 应用（例如 Amazon Cognito、Okta 或 Auth0）中，将临时回调地址替换为 <portal-url>/callback。不要添加末尾斜杠。这不是 GitHub 或 Slack 应用的回调地址。那些应用使用唯一的 AgentCore Identity callbackUrl。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48e99d7a7483701f",
      "translationZh": "对于每个 3LO 网关目标，将默认返回 URL 设置为 <portal-url>/connect/callback。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37f31b469b87118f",
      "translationZh": "确认每个出站提供商应用都包含在创建其 OAuth 凭证提供商时返回的 AgentCore Identity 回调 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef13ce058a6a55b5",
      "translationZh": "在浏览器中测试门户 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c99babc4d5ec60c8",
      "translationZh": "通过经批准的通信渠道将门户 URL 发送给开发团队。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e56d205fd304768",
      "translationZh": "回调 URL 参考",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35590782e2c23f7d",
      "translationZh": "企业 IdP 应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62c4bd6ab681a040",
      "translationZh": "在门户登录后将用户重定向回来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0089679460b44d87",
      "translationZh": "将网关目标作为默认返回 URL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c633bf9d5061f193",
      "translationZh": "将用户重定向回托管会话绑定端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0421291c13e85241",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Identity 的 callbackUrl",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4b3da5233f3ad2",
      "translationZh": "出站提供方应用程序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0af28c39808e2f0c",
      "translationZh": "将提供方的授权码发送至 AgentCore Identity",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fed949f5834cbfae",
      "translationZh": "完成提供方回调和网关目标的配置后，请在分享门户 URL 之前验证最终的管理员配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf2d43ab564e2fc3",
      "translationZh": "在浏览器中打开门户 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15799bbc58a9e297",
      "translationZh": "使用企业身份进行身份验证。随后，门户使用其 IAM 执行角色来获取网关已配置的目标及其连接状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d65086c64a1e240",
      "translationZh": "在 Connections 页面上，检查 GitHub 和 Slack OAuth 客户端及其目标状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f42c32aeead9f6d",
      "translationZh": "为 GitHub 选择 Connect。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9434d84465386e14",
      "translationZh": "在 GitHub 的授权同意页面上检查权限范围，并批准访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f61786ca7699385c",
      "translationZh": "浏览器返回门户后，确认 GitHub 显示“已连接”，而 Slack 仍显示“未连接”。这表明各个提供方的授权是相互独立的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59abeba9ffef104b",
      "translationZh": "如果智能体需要使用 Slack，请选择 Slack 的“连接”，选择工作区，审查所请求的权限，然后批准该应用。否则，请让 Slack 保持未连接状态，直到需要使用它时再连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11ebbf01474889bc",
      "translationZh": "返回 IDE 或 MCP 客户端，该客户端应配置为使用与 Consent 门户关联的同一个 AgentCore Gateway，然后通过该网关重试相应的 GitHub 或 Slack 工具调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "791f492284a10413",
      "translationZh": "以下截图展示了操作演示中的一些有用检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0a3c9d51d50a5f3",
      "translationZh": "图 7：Consent 门户发现 GitHub OAuth 客户端及其目标。在用户授予访问权限之前，两者都保持“未连接”状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c84843faeb5c9405",
      "translationZh": "图 8：在用户授权之前，GitHub 会显示 OAuth 应用请求的权限范围和组织访问权限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a75cff5082133381",
      "translationZh": "图 9：GitHub 返回授权结果后，门户完成会话绑定，并将 OAuth 客户端及其目标显示为“已连接”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f383e84e2725e47f",
      "translationZh": "图 10：GitHub 保持“已连接”状态，而 Slack 为“未连接”，这表明用户会分别为每个出站提供方独立授予同意",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "741bdc73c51ecae1",
      "translationZh": "门户验证 IdP 响应，并建立加密的浏览器会话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3634385598530770",
      "translationZh": "门户使用其执行角色列出所关联网关的 3LO 目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7beb9412bac1324a",
      "translationZh": "当用户选择 Connect 时，门户调用 GetResourceOauth2Token，并接收授权 URL 和会话 URI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e417070430dcf6ae",
      "translationZh": "提供商将授权码返回给 AgentCore Identity 后，浏览器返回门户的托管会话绑定端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e3edd8e884b8b40a",
      "translationZh": "门户使用已通过身份验证的用户上下文调用 CompleteResourceTokenAuth。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25070ea2923a4d74",
      "translationZh": "当提供商返回刷新令牌时，AgentCore Identity 会将其存储，并在当前访问令牌过期后自动使用它获取新的访问令牌。有时没有可用的有效刷新令牌，因为提供商未签发刷新令牌，或者刷新令牌已过期或被撤销。在这种情况下，当访问令牌无法再使用时，用户必须返回 Consent 门户并重新授权。在提供商支持的情况下，将其配置为签发刷新令牌。例如，为 GitHub 启用用户到服务器的令牌过期机制，或为 Slack 启用令牌轮换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "233fb24199cecd7d",
      "translationZh": "开发者下次打开门户时，已连接的提供商仍然可见。除非授权被撤销、过期或需要重新同意，否则开发者无需再次批准提供商。开发者也可以选择 Disconnect，然后稍后重新连接该提供商。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0f44b5d91df38fd7",
      "translationZh": "在 AWS CloudTrail 中审查同意活动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "505335a9da0de837",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 会在 AWS CloudTrail 中记录同意授权操作。在 CloudTrail 事件历史记录中，将事件来源筛选为 bedrock-agentcore.amazonaws.com，然后查看以下事件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c26459957984d51",
      "translationZh": "GetResourceOauth2Token：当门户为某个提供商启动 OAuth 授权时发生。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "086ad4dc293f7179",
      "translationZh": "CompleteResourceTokenAuth：当会话绑定完成时发生。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2810f06109919f13",
      "translationZh": "GetWorkloadAccessTokenForJWT：当门户为已通过身份验证的用户获取网关访问权限时发生。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f8008c493dc31e",
      "translationZh": "GetResourceOauth2Token 事件会标明凭证提供商、请求的权限范围、OAuth 流程、门户执行角色和区域。敏感的令牌值和状态值会被隐去。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fc85c863ccb6dce",
      "translationZh": "对于失败情况，请结合 errorCode 和 errorMessage，以及事件时间、代入的角色、区域、凭证提供商和请求的权限范围，确定原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f28754a7ef1248b6",
      "translationZh": "当您不再需要这些资源时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9690a6aab0de3c23",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 控制台并删除 Consent 门户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f4939283acc44e5",
      "translationZh": "从企业 IdP 应用程序和网关目标中移除门户回调 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90c9a3b81ba44c21",
      "translationZh": "删除引用出站凭证提供程序的网关目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6997e76d53fa39db",
      "translationZh": "如果出站 OAuth 凭证提供程序和企业 IdP 凭证提供程序未在其他地方使用，请将其删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b148de1304dbc95",
      "translationZh": "如果没有其他资源使用门户执行角色，请将其删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bdbc516cce3f80e",
      "translationZh": "注意：先删除网关目标，再删除其出站凭证提供程序。仍被目标引用的凭证提供程序无法删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b10f067d808fa99f",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Consent 门户为管理员提供了一种托管方式，用于为 AgentCore Gateway 配置最终用户 OAuth 同意授权。管理员连接企业 IdP、执行角色、网关和出站提供程序，然后分享一个 URL。最终用户进行身份验证、查看可用的提供程序，并分别授予同意。门户负责处理浏览器流程和托管会话绑定，而 AgentCore Identity 则在令牌保管库中保护由此产生的用户令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2105b9d3bb6978e6",
      "translationZh": "有关使用 Microsoft Entra ID 和 Okta 的端到端示例，请参阅 GitHub 上的以下 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06b33860694a2668",
      "translationZh": "具有授权码流程目标的同意授权门户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bef090543995d8c",
      "translationZh": "使用 OAuth 授权码流程的 AgentCore Gateway 目标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb61f4e1b1545874",
      "translationZh": "要了解更多信息，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "session binding",
      "briefZh": "会话绑定",
      "explanationZh": "将 OAuth 授权安全地关联到批准授权的用户的过程。"
    },
    {
